WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
(pensive music)

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.530
- What is it?

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.583
- It is a stapler.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.060
- What's it do?

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.430
- There is a tube and a slide

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.200
where individual pieces of metal

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.740
are pushed forward

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.643
and then punched into the paper.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.423
And voila, they are held fast.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.513
- Right, and that's it?

00:00:27.398 --> 00:00:30.630
(paper rustling)

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.670
- Worst part of my job is when a baby

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.460
gets stuck inside a woman
and I have to go in,

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.130
sometimes elbow deep,

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.621
turn their head and
shoulders and pull it out.

00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:42.327
- Jesus, I did not know this.

00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:44.050
- And as I'm not a vet...

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.880
- Never having children. Never.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.540
- Hence, the mother of invention.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.743
I have invented forceps.

00:00:52.693 --> 00:00:55.730
(metal creaking)

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:56.822
In labor.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.655
(woman screaming)

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:04.402
(metal creaking)

00:01:04.402 --> 00:01:07.319
(fruit squelching)

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.150
- So much of a woman's life is wasted

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:18.610
being tied into and out of our dresses.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:19.443
- Mm.

00:01:19.443 --> 00:01:20.276
- As I tell my girls,

00:01:20.276 --> 00:01:24.010
this time could be spent
reading, writing, painting.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:24.843
- Indeed.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:31.183
Oh!

00:01:32.114 --> 00:01:34.080
- It is merely two strips of material

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.870
treated with tree sap that
runs the length of the garment.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:39.523
And, off please.

00:01:42.124 --> 00:01:45.291
(audience applauding)

00:01:47.178 --> 00:01:49.460
- It is brilliant, Katya Velcra,

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.810
but let me consider the
unseen ramifications.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:53.853
- And many rapes.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.423
- I call it the Exaltation.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.030
- Sounds promising.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:04.820
- It is to be four stories
high, 70 feet wide.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.110
One climbs this ladder to
the cart. It seats four men.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:08.943
- Or women.

00:02:08.943 --> 00:02:10.530
- Yes, women should ride it too,

00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:13.080
as well as children.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.030
- Wonderful.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:17.510
- Now, gravity and the parabolic form

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:21.270
give us the momentum
for an up push, then...

00:02:24.512 --> 00:02:29.512
(cart rattling)
(crowd gasping)

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.110
- How do they not die?

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:31.943
- They do.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.380
That is the point of the Exaltation.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.890
The journey ends in the
inescapable conclusion, death.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:39.723
- What?

00:02:39.723 --> 00:02:42.340
- The old, the infirm, terminally ill,

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.680
the suicidal, the bored,

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.920
have one final moment of sky and sun

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.883
before crashing to their death.

00:02:52.657 --> 00:02:53.780
(whimsical music)

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.267
- We shall go with the stapler.

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:59.593
- Ah, bravo! We've embossed it.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.577
- Take the "great" part off of it.

00:03:06.821 --> 00:03:08.321
- Congratulations!

